# Read by the Gemini CLI after .gitignore. The comparison screenshots (_reference/ours-*) are
# git-ignored because every check redoes them, but the CLI's file reader refuses git-ignored files,
# and /recreate-site has the model look at them. This lets it read them, and the original's
# section crops and scroll frames (also git-ignored).
!foundry/sites/*/_reference/ours-*
!foundry/sites/*/_reference/*-section-*.png
!foundry/sites/*/_reference/*-scroll-*.png
